    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "――にぎやかなお祭り、最高～っ！！",
            "enText": "Lively festivals are the beeest!",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": 3118855121887993648,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "――華麗なるオペラこそ、至高ッ！！",
            "enText": "The opera reigns supreme!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -3961145984415011782,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "――イィヤッホオォ～ゥ！！\r\n面白けりゃ、なんだっていいぜ～ッ！！",
            "enText": "WOOHOO! I like anything that's fun!",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 4151965905387353493,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "はーっはっはっは！　ここに集いし者たちは、\r\nみな人々を魅せる才に溢れた者というわけだ！",
            "enText": "Haaah ha ha ha! It appears all of us\ngathered here today have an aptitude\nfor charming people!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -4258904066732746528,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "はい！　才はよくわかりませんけど\r\nあたし、盛り上がるの大好きですっ。",
            "enText": "Yeah! Not sure if it has anything\nto do with attitude, but I'm always\ndown to have a good time!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": -66639718268024746,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "おう！　シーンとしてたらつまんねーからな！\r\n祭りでもオペラでもセパタクローでも、\nゴルシちゃんは大歓迎だぞ☆",
            "enText": "Yeah! Why stay quiet when we could get the\ncrowd to make some noise?! Festivals, opera,\nsepak takraw — you name it! I welcome all of\nthe above!☆",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -4250339654707504243,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "フッ……いっそのこと、\r\n3人で劇団でも立ち上げてみるかい？\n劇団名は『ブラックゴールドオペラオー』！！",
            "enText": "Hah. While we're here, shall we form\na theater trio? We can call our troupe\nthe \"Black Gold Opera O\"!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": -5199154591246189748,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ゴールドシップ",
            "enName": "Gold Ship",
            "jpText": "だーっはっはっは！！\r\n黒なのか！？　金なのか！？\nオペラオーにいたっちゃ、色じゃねーし！！",
            "enText": "BWAHAHA! Is it black or is it gold?\nOpera O's not even a color!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": 269596700848488200,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "劇団！　盛り上がりそうです！　となると、\r\n歌の練習もしなくちゃいけませんねっ。",
            "enText": "A theater group? That sounds fun!\nWe better start practicing our singing!",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": 1757504184186454092,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "キタサンブラック",
            "enName": "Kitasan Black",
            "jpText": "それでは、声を1つに合わせて\r\nいきましょう！　せーの――",
            "enText": "Okay, let's try and sing in unison!\nReady? And —",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": -2248187882666835684,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "3人",
            "enName": "All Three",
            "jpText": "●※☆×△♪▼□！！！！！！！！",
            "enText": "●※☆×△♪▼□!!!!!!",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": -7909369094125850796,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "テイエムオペラオー",
            "enName": "T.M. Opera O",
            "jpText": "うむ――バラバラ！！\r\nこれでこそ、芸術ッ！！",
            "enText": "Mmm… We are cacophonous!\nThis, my friends, is art!",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 5369324570346300640,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
